# "highest_mean_cpm" : keep the single source locus with the highest mean CPM as
#                      the representative of each mouse symbol. SAFE DEFAULT.
# "sum_counts"       : sum counts across all source loci sharing a symbol.
#                      Appropriate ONLY when the duplicated rows are fragments
